+    *   Visibility MLP ($\text{MLP}_\phi$): Maps $(\mathbf{x}, \boldsymbol{\omega}_i)$ to expected termination depth $\tilde{t}_0$.
+*   Environment lighting map $E(\mathbf{x}, \boldsymbol{\omega})$.
 
 **Outputs:**
